WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
kit. Place the sheep brain in the

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
dissecting tray, dorsal surface up.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Observe and identify the following parts

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
of the brain: cerebrum, cerebellum,

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.000
spinal cord, medial longitudinal

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:19.000
fissure, right and left hemispheres,

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:23.000
olfactory bulb, and optic

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:28.000
nerve. Bisect the brain along the

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:32.000
medial longitudinal
